# URL of the FastAPI backend's action endpoint.
# "/api" goes through the Vite dev-server proxy (see vite.config.js), so the app works over https://,
# from other devices on your network, and the microphone is allowed.
# - Running via `docker compose up`: leave this as-is (matches the
#   "backend" service published on localhost:8000).
# - Running the frontend with `npm run dev` on your host machine while
#   the backend runs elsewhere (e.g. also via docker compose), this is
#   still correct since the backend container publishes port 8000 to
#   your laptop.
VITE_API_URL=/api
